{"id":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q055","title":"第55題","version":"3","batch":"115-1-med1","sourceSha256":"d7fff7299e44a7768876250644386016f2c62a24418249fe391596e0f09007a5","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_3ef145365d388191bf193b0a8de61beb","sourceAnchor":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q055","shortHtml":"<div><p>既有題庫解析（作者未另標示）</p><div><div><div><div><div><p>骨骼肌收縮時 Ca2+ 與 troponin C 結合，使 tropomyosin 移開，肌凝蛋白可與 actin 交互作用。平滑肌沒有 troponin，Ca2+ 與 calmodulin 結合後活化 MLCK，使 myosin light chain 磷酸化而啟動收縮。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>","html":"<div><div><h2>第55題</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><b>原題答案：</b>D</p></div><div><div><div><h3>閱讀詳解</h3><p>先看鈣離子<strong>結合誰</strong>，再追它如何啟動肌動蛋白與肌凝蛋白互動：骨骼肌主要是鈣結合<strong>肌鈣蛋白 C（troponin C）</strong>；平滑肌則是鈣結合<strong>攜鈣素／鈣調蛋白（calmodulin）</strong>，所以 D 最適當。</p><p>原題把 troponin 稱為「旋轉素」。它位於骨骼肌薄肌絲，鈣結合後讓原肌球蛋白（tropomyosin，原題「旋轉肌凝蛋白」）移開，露出肌動蛋白的肌凝蛋白結合位點。平滑肌沒有這套 troponin 開關；鈣－攜鈣素複合體先活化<strong>肌凝蛋白輕鏈激酶（myosin light-chain kinase，MLCK）</strong>，再使肌凝蛋白的調節輕鏈磷酸化、提高其與肌動蛋白互動的能力。</p></div><div><h3>骨骼肌和平滑肌的收縮開關</h3><div><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>比較</th><th>骨骼肌</th><th>平滑肌</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>主要鈣感受器</td><td>肌鈣蛋白 C</td><td>攜鈣素</td></tr><tr><td>主要啟動步驟</td><td>肌鈣蛋白改變構形，原肌球蛋白移開</td><td>鈣－攜鈣素活化 MLCK</td></tr><tr><td>調節焦點</td><td>薄肌絲的結合位點可否接近</td><td>肌凝蛋白調節輕鏈的磷酸化</td></tr><tr><td>共同結果</td><td colspan=\"2\">肌凝蛋白與肌動蛋白形成交互橋，產生滑動與張力</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1482px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.436046511627907\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/bd3b492766cc4e7e01d84d81d2c47fe9d48236a834ce30ce482167366c341f2b.png\" alt=\"平滑肌：從鈣到 MLCK，再到肌凝蛋白\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1482\" height=\"1032\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/bd3b492766cc4e7e01d84d81d2c47fe9d48236a834ce30ce482167366c341f2b.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>平滑肌：從鈣到 MLCK，再到肌凝蛋白</p><p>沿圖中央由上往下讀：鈣從胞外及胞內儲存處增加，與 calmodulin（攜鈣素）結合；複合體活化 MLCK，讓肌凝蛋白調節輕鏈磷酸化。下方紫色 P 表示磷酸基團，交互橋作用後張力增加。</p><p>David Nascari、Alan Sved，<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Calcium_and_smooth_muscle_cell_contraction.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Calcium and smooth muscle cell contraction</a>，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>。沿用原圖，像素未修改。</p></figcaption></figure><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1482px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.436046511627907\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/842fc981ae9587838cb92351fa8fb66300474c938c8a7baeb34d5905121c8dab.png\" alt=\"平滑肌：鈣回收與肌凝蛋白去磷酸化\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1482\" height=\"1032\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/842fc981ae9587838cb92351fa8fb66300474c938c8a7baeb34d5905121c8dab.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>平滑肌：鈣回收與肌凝蛋白去磷酸化</p><p>鈣離子被送回儲存處或排出細胞後，鈣－攜鈣素活化減少；圖下方的 myosin phosphatase 是肌凝蛋白輕鏈磷酸酶，移除磷酸基團。把兩張圖並看，可區分激酶加磷酸、磷酸酶去磷酸的方向。</p><p>David Nascari、Alan Sved，<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Calcium_and_smooth_muscle_cell_relaxation.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Calcium and smooth muscle cell relaxation</a>，<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>。沿用原圖，像素未修改。</p></figcaption></figure></div></div><div><h3>選項辨析</h3><dl><dt>A</dt><dd>前半正確；後半錯在說鈣直接結合肌凝蛋白就啟動平滑肌收縮。中間必須辨認攜鈣素與 MLCK 的主要路徑。</dd><dt>B</dt><dd>骨骼肌薄肌絲調節的前半可成立；但平滑肌主要鈣感受器是<strong>攜鈣素</strong>，不是一個放在粗肌絲上直接接受鈣的 troponin 式調節蛋白。</dd><dt>C</dt><dd>把兩種系統都說錯：骨骼肌的主要鈣開關不是鈣直接結合 MLCK；平滑肌也不由鈣直接結合原肌球蛋白來啟動。</dd><dt>D</dt><dd>正確。鈣結合肌鈣蛋白與攜鈣素，分別對應骨骼肌和平滑肌的主要收縮調節。</dd></dl></div><div><h3>一起考：啟動與維持張力不完全相同</h3><p>若鈣已升高但 MLCK 被抑制，肌凝蛋白輕鏈磷酸化與新交互橋活化的趨勢會降低。相反地，輕鏈磷酸酶活性降低，可讓同樣的鈣濃度產生較高收縮反應，稱為<strong>鈣敏感性增加</strong>。</p><p>平滑肌還可透過<strong>閂鎖狀態（latch state）</strong>，以較慢交互橋循環、較低能量消耗維持張力。因此不能把「胞內鈣下降」與「張力立刻完全歸零」視為永遠相同的一件事。</p></div><details><summary>來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/10-2-skeletal-muscle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax，Skeletal Muscle</a>：薄肌絲的肌鈣蛋白與原肌球蛋白</li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/10-8-smooth-muscle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax，Smooth Muscle</a>：鈣－攜鈣素－MLCK主要路徑及閂鎖交互橋</li><li><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/14506307/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Somlyo &amp; Somlyo，Ca2+ sensitivity of smooth muscle and nonmuscle myosin II</a>：激酶／磷酸酶平衡與鈣敏感性</li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Calcium_and_smooth_muscle_cell_contraction.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Calcium and smooth muscle cell contraction</a></li><li><a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Calcium_and_smooth_muscle_cell_relaxation.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Calcium and smooth muscle cell relaxation</a></li></ul></details></div></div></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"原題答案：D"}